Quoted excerpts
============================================================================

The TR1 lessons in content/modules/tr1/lessons/, which the site serves again as Markdown in
public/md/tr1/, quote short excerpts of four projects' source files. Each excerpt is a block
headed with its path, its lines and a pinned commit, as in "nanovllm/engine/scheduler.py,
lines 29 to 55 at bb823b3", and the prose above it links the same lines at the same commit.
The one-line quotes in content/claims/ and in packages/sim/lifecycle are the same kind of
excerpt, each with its source path, its line or lines, and a pinned commit or tag.

The excerpts stay under their own licences, which are below. enginespace's own licence,
when the owner chooses it (O-3), does not cover them, nor any other short quotation of
these projects elsewhere in this repository, such as the research notes. A few claims quote
other sources, such as kernelspace's lessons, the wrk2 and TensorRT-LLM repositories, blog
posts and papers; each names its source by URL. Their licences are not listed here and have
not been checked [unverified].

